    <item>
      <title>Oracle与Snowflake“梦幻联动”：企业数据，这下真要“起飞”了！</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/oraclesnowflake-20251128144006933-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 28 Nov 2025 14:40:06 +0800</pubDate>
